            <ArticleTitle>Letter: Pellagra as the initial presentation of Crohn disease.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>12</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Pellagra is a nutritional disease caused by the deficiency of niacin. We describe a case of pellagra as the initial presentation of Crohn disease, which has been rarely described in the literature.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
